I'm also going to
try to introduce

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:27.920
Power BI to some
R developers that

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:29.498
is not familiar with the tool.

00:02:29.498 --> 00:02:31.790
You probably heard of it,
